# Ignore rules for Dockerfile.web (see Dockerfile.engine.dockerignore for why this file exists).
#
# Default-deny. `.env`/`.env.local` sit in the repo root and apps/web respectively and both hold
# real secrets; an allowlist means a new secret file added tomorrow is excluded by default
# instead of shipped by default.
*

!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!apps/web

apps/web/node_modules
apps/web/.next
apps/web/.env
apps/web/.env.local
apps/web/*.tsbuildinfo
